<title>NEW ZEALAND: Kiwi Income half yr profit rises to NZ$9.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Kiwi Income half yr profit rises to NZ$9.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr result to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     9.5 vs 7.7</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    3.84 vs 4.07</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				  3.9 vs 4.1</p>
<p>    Turnover				    17.7 vs 14.3</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			     12.8 vs 9.9</p>
<p>    Tax					    2.9 vs 2.1</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	 247.3 vs 189.3</p>
<p>Dividend carries 0.01200 cps imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date Nov 29</p>
<p>Reg date Nov 22</p>
<p>    Ex div   Nov 25</p>
<p>Note - Kiwi Income Property Trust Ltd is a property investment company. -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
